<div id="wd-0e7002a0" class="wp-block-wd-accordion-pane wd-accordion-item"><div class="wd-accordion-title"><div class="wd-accordion-title-text"><span>My order hasn't arrived yet. Where is it?</span></div><span class="wd-accordion-opener"></span></div><div class="wd-accordion-content"><div class="wd-accordion-content-inner"><!-- wp:wd/paragraph {"blockId":"c26a0ab6-261c-41fa-801f-9c3ab9bb89b0"} -->
<p id="wd-c26a0ab6" class="wp-block-wd-paragraph">Keep the product in its original packaging along with all documents confirming the purchase and refund. You will need this for further communication with the seller and the payment system.</p>
<!-- /wp:wd/paragraph --></div></div></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/accordion-pane -->

<!-- wp:wd/accordion-pane {"blockId":"5e2546b8-96de-46cd-be33-506477e6f0dc"} -->
<div id="wd-5e2546b8" class="wp-block-wd-accordion-pane wd-accordion-item"><div class="wd-accordion-title"><div class="wd-accordion-title-text"><span>Do you deliver on public holidays?</span></div><span class="wd-accordion-opener"></span></div><div class="wd-accordion-content"><div class="wd-accordion-content-inner"><!-- wp:wd/paragraph {"blockId":"08a14cfc-44e2-4948-be4d-48b14b27c322"} -->
<p id="wd-08a14cfc" class="wp-block-wd-paragraph">Check the email you received after placing your order. It should contain information about the status of your order and the expected delivery date.</p>
<!-- /wp:wd/paragraph --></div></div></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/accordion-pane -->

<!-- wp:wd/accordion-pane {"blockId":"bf5af1a2-33f0-4443-9597-62e588005b91"} -->
